OS command isolation uses @anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime 0.0.83,
Copyright Anthropic PBC, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
Its source, licence, notices and platform helpers are distributed in the installed
npm dependency, bundled with this package. This project does not imply endorsement
by Anthropic or OpenAI.

The bundle also includes @pondwader/socks5-server 1.0.10 (MIT), commander 12.1.0
(MIT), node-forge 1.4.3 (BSD-3-Clause option), and zod 4.6.7 (MIT). Their original
licence and copyright texts remain in each package's LICENSE file.

The agent uses the runtime as a library. No Codex executable or Open WebUI source
is included. The lockfile records the exact dependency artifacts and integrity.

The optional browser wrapper installs Microsoft @playwright/mcp 0.0.85 and
Playwright 1.66.0-alpha-2026-11-09, licensed under Apache License 2.0, with their
original notices. Browser binaries and these dependencies are not bundled in the
agent npm package. Their separate installation is described in docs/browser.md.
